{"sections":[{"slug":"高阶模","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"高阶模"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶模</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"高阶模"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">高阶模是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">环上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/结合代数上的模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模</span>"}},{"Plain":"” <span lang=\"zh\">这一概念的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/范畴化","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">范畴化</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">正如环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的模是其谱</span> $\\operatorname{Spec} A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的高阶模是</span> $\\operatorname{Spec} A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶拟凝聚层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶拟凝聚层</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, "},{"Local":{"url":"/交换代数","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">交换代数</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的模范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mod} (A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">仍是交换代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而可以继续考虑其上的模</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">环</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶模范畴便是</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">取模范畴</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">操作的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">次迭代</span>: “$\\mathsf{Mod}^n (A) = \\mathsf{Mod} (\\mathsf{Mod}^{n-1} (A))$”.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">为了明确上述定义所在的范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们需要</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/高阶可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">高阶可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">记</span> $n\\mathsf{Pr}$ <span lang=\"zh\">为可表现</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴的范畴</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">环上的高阶模范畴</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">约定</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">这里的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴是指</span> $(\\infty ,n)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">环是指</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/E∞-环","text":"E∞-<span lang=\"zh\">环</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">环上的模范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在传统情形中称为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/导出范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">导出范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":" $D(A)$. <span lang=\"zh\">暂且忽略基数的大小问题</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> ($A$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性可表现范畴</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">对于交换环</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">考虑</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">模范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Mod}(A) \\in \\mathsf{CAlg}(1\\mathsf{Pr})$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> “$A$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可表现范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"” <span lang=\"zh\">构成的对称幺半可表现</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>\n$$\r\n1\\mathsf{Pr}_A = \\mathsf{Mod}_{1\\mathsf{Pr}}(\\mathsf{Mod}(A)) \\in \\mathsf{CAlg}(2\\mathsf{Pr}),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">归纳地定义</span> “$A$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性可表现</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">构成的对称幺半可表现</span> $(n+1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>\n$$\r\nn\\mathsf{Pr}_A = \\mathsf{Mod}_{n\\mathsf{Pr}}((n-1)\\mathsf{Pr}_A)\\in \\mathsf{CAlg}((n+1)\\mathsf{Pr}).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">可表现范畴上的高阶模范畴</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong> ($C$-<span lang=\"zh\">线性可表现范畴</span>). <span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $C \\in \\mathsf{CAlg}(1\\mathsf{Pr})$, <span lang=\"zh\">也可定义</span>\n$$\r\n1\\mathsf{Pr}_C = \\mathsf{Mod}_{1\\mathsf{Pr}}(C) \\in \\mathsf{CAlg}(2\\mathsf{Pr}),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">并归纳定义</span>\n$$\r\nn\\mathsf{Pr}_C = \\mathsf{Mod}_{n\\mathsf{Pr}}((n-1)\\mathsf{Pr}_C) \\in \\mathsf{CAlg}((n+1)\\mathsf{Pr}).\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}}]}